                       NSPConnectionInfo, NSPControlConnection, NSPJSONWebToken, 
                       NSPPrivacyProxyAggregatorConfig, NSPPrivacyProxyAggregatorRequest, 
                       NSPPrivacyProxyAggregatorResponse, NSPPrivacyProxyAggregatorService, 
                       NSPPrivacyProxyAggregatorTokenConfig, NSPPrivacyProxyAuthenticationInfo, 
                       NSPPrivacyProxyAuxiliaryAuthInfo, NSPPrivacyProxyBAAValidation, 
                       NSPPrivacyProxyBlindRSARequests, NSPPrivacyProxyBlindRSAResponse, 
                       NSPPrivacyProxyCacheConfig, NSPPrivacyProxyConfiguration, 
                       NSPPrivacyProxyCost, NSPPrivacyProxyCostJWTToBlindRSARequest, 
